# U31: the skill set manager (SkillSetListControl in SkillsTab:OpenSkillSetManagePopup, the
# stand-in "Manage sets" button) of allflame_exp_048. New (RenameSet: "Second", RETURN);
# double-click row 2 (OnSelClick: SetActiveSkillSet, the empty group list); Copy row 1
# (RenameSet with addOnName: "Copy"); F2 on row 3 (RenameSet: "CopX"); Delete row 2, the
# active set (confirm popup: SetActiveSkillSet of the previous row); drag row 1 below row 2
# (OnOrderChange: modFlag); Done. The popups are centred, so the script runs at its own
# screen (u32 d_sets form).
#! u31-expect Enter name for this skill set:
#! u31-expect (Current)
#! u31-expect Are you sure you want to delete 'Second'?
screen 1920 1080 1.5
